    "description": "Six Senses India Capital India is actively seeking a talented and motivated Front Office Manager to join our dynamic team in Allahabad. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Six Senses India Capital India:\nSix Senses India Capital India is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Manage reservations and optimize room revenue through yield management\n• Handle guest complaints and resolve issues promptly\n• Ensure compliance with FSSAI, health, and safety regulations\n• Deliver exceptional guest experiences in line with brand standards\n• Assist in menu planning, costing, and food festival coordination\n• Prepare daily operating reports and present to management\n• Coordinate with travel agents and OTAs for occupancy optimization\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Bachelor's degree in a relevant field\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Revenue Management\n• Proficiency in Crisis Management\n• Proficiency in F&B Service\n• Proficiency in Customer Relations\n• Proficiency in Housekeeping Standards\n• Proficiency in Opera PMS\n• Proficiency in Hotel Management\n• Proficiency in Barista Skills\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Learning & development budget\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Allahabad, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Six Senses India Capital India!",
